    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT OTHER GAMES FROM OPALA PROJECT</h1><p><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451560/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1699549081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451560/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1699549081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451560/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1699549081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451560/extras/bea4ff12a2c32955f5e0fd16c4d77923.avif?t=1699549081\" /></div><br><br>This is an original puzzle game inspired by basketball. With the ball, you need to move around the grids until you finish your movements limit, find the correct position to make shots and then finish your turn by scoring a basket!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Characters move according to their ability, but the goal is to use your movements to reach the basket;<br></li><li> 50 creative levels with increasing complexity;<br></li><li> A basketball game without basketball. This is an entirely new game concept for basketball lovers and newbies (you don't need to know basketball to play it);<br></li><li> Enjoy the beauty and dangers of Mars and many cats;<br></li><li> Soundtracks originally composed.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451560/extras/4eff713be3541fb4892e43ed5e04f3c4.avif?t=1699549081\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451560/extras/bea4ff12a2c32955f5e0fd16c4d77923.avif?t=1699549081\" /></div><br><br>This is an original puzzle game inspired by basketball. With the ball, you need to move around the grids until you finish your movements limit, find the correct position to make shots and then finish your turn by scoring a basket!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Characters move according to their ability, but the goal is to use your movements to reach the basket;<br></li><li> 50 creative levels with increasing complexity;<br></li><li> A basketball game without basketball. This is an entirely new game concept for basketball lovers and newbies (you don't need to know basketball to play it);<br></li><li> Enjoy the beauty and dangers of Mars and many cats;<br></li><li> Soundtracks originally composed.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451560/extras/4eff713be3541fb4892e43ed5e04f3c4.avif?t=1699549081\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Play basketball. In Mars. With cats. Are you ready for the whole galaxy's hardest matches? Solve puzzles and win the Bascatball intergalactic championship!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cDifficulty: What if we unlock 100% of our brain?\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201c50 hex-based levels of dunking cats on Mars. Use all moves and passes before going for the hoop. Turn-based without undo, but great presentation, good price and plenty difficult in the final third.\u201d<br>Puzzle Lovers<br><br>\u201cVery fun game with very interesting and challenging mechanics.\u201d<br>Very fun \u2013 Steam Reviewer<br>",
